-title><source>Urban and Peri-Urban Developments&#x02014;Structures, Processes and Solutions</source><year>2006</year><publisher-loc>Cologne</publisher-loc><publisher-name>University of Cologne</publisher-name><fpage>95</fpage><lpage>104</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Sutandyo-Buchholz A. How Essential is Community-based Solid Waste Management in Peri-urban Areas? Case-study of Jakarta, Indonesia. In: Knie C, ed. Urban and Peri-Urban Developments&#x02014;Structures, Processes and Solutions. Cologne: University of Cologne; 2006:95&#x02013;104. </citation></ref><ref id="CR13"><label>13.</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Abrams</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Abu-Lughod</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Hay</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Squatting and squatters</article-title><source>Third World Urbanisation</source><year>1977</year><publisher-loc>London</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Methuen</publisher-name><fpage>298</fpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Abrams C. Squatting and squatters. In: Abu-Lughod J, Hay R Jr, eds. Third World Urbanisation. London: Methuen; 1977:298. </citation></ref><ref id="CR14"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fraser</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Housing and planning in Singapore</article-title><source>Town Plan Rev</source><year>1952</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>5</fpage><lpage>25</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Fraser JM. Housing and planning in Singapore. Town Plan Rev. 1952;23:5&#x02013;25. </citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn><p>Ooi is with the National Institute of Education, Nanyang Technological University, 